WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.260
Last Sunday, a tragic accident took the life of Owen Hart.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.590
He was 34.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:11.640
There are no words that can express the profound sorrow felt today by so many of us

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:14.910
who knew and loved this very special human being.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:21.040
Fans throughout the world shared a small portion of Owen's life through his various ring personas,

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.550
but to know Owen Hart, the human being, was pure joy.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.960
Owen loved this business and loved to entertain both in it and out of it.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.680
of the ring. He was a consummate performer and a legendary prankster. In the extended family of

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:43.540
professional wrestlers, respect does not come easily and is not taken lightly. Owen Hart had

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:51.550
that respect. He was more than just one of the boys. Owen Hart was a friend and a brother to all.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:57.920
Our locker room and our lives will never ever be the same again.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:05.330
A loving son, brother, uncle, husband, and father.

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:09.460
Owen is survived by his wife Martha, his son Oge, and daughter Athena.

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:13.160
Our prayers go out to them and the entire Hart family.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:20.150
With heavy hearts and the deepest of sympathies for his family, we say goodbye.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:27.750
If the legacy of a man's life is measured by the lives he's touched and how much he has loved,

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:29.960
then a big piece of...

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.580
Owen Hart will live on in all of us.

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:48.010
Memorial tributes in Owen Hart's name may be made directly to Owen's favorite charity,

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:55.270
the Alberta Children's Hospital, 1820 Richmond Road, Southwest, Calgary, Alberta, Canada, T2T 5C7.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:59.970
This is a very worthwhile charity, and we certainly encourage everyone to donate and help.

